[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9063.51, "timestamp": "02:31:03", "text": "重要的是，我不喜欢这种情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9072.15, "timestamp": "02:31:12", "text": "只有硬币才是你应该拥有的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9075.349, "timestamp": "02:31:15", "text": "你可以拿走，对，有时候可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9079.99, "timestamp": "02:31:19", "text": "你会找到钥匙，啊，嗯，用来解锁一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9082.15, "timestamp": "02:31:22", "text": "已锁定"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9084.27, "timestamp": "02:31:24", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9090.389, "timestamp": "02:31:30", "text": "好了，那是雨。我当时想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9098.309, "timestamp": "02:31:38", "text": "我们。所以，就像你们都能看到的那样。哦，我明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9104.309, "timestamp": "02:31:44", "text": "钥匙。而你可以通过解锁这个来做到这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9112.07, "timestamp": "02:31:52", "text": "有时还要尝试记住哪些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9113.83, "timestamp": "02:31:53", "text": "你正要穿过的那扇门，因为有些门"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9115.91, "timestamp": "02:31:55", "text": "有点像假的"}]